      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Adds \"Hello, <@user> I am Forkman ...\" intro message \n\nwaits for AWS to process\n\n\nReceives either A. or B.  conditions\n\nAnswers with A. or B. \n\nAdd Feedback message buttons\n\n\nPings ASU server staff if the user is not satified with the\nanswer. ",
      "fontSize": 16.990475027901788,
      "fontFamily": 5,
